{
  "info": {
    "name": "Reactive Distributed Transactions Lab — Incremento 01",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Raul Bolivar. Contratos del primer ZIP: POST /api/v1/orders y GET /api/v1/orders/{id}; respuesta plana orderId/sagaId/command/status/failureReason. Importar y ajustar las variables de URL a los puertos publicados en Compose. Ejecutar carpetas en orden con Collection Runner. Sin autenticación. Seis escenarios con validación de creación y lectura persistida; cuatro health checks; cinco validaciones. Las compensaciones reales deben inspeccionarse en PostgreSQL: este incremento no expone GET de operaciones de participantes. No incluye idempotencia, reinicios ni timeout/retry porque todavía no están implementados. No ejecutada contra tu entorno local."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "orderUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "inventoryUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "paymentUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8082",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "shippingUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8083",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "sagaId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId_NONE",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId_INVENTORY_UNAVAILABLE",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId_PAYMENT_REJECTED",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId_SHIPPING_UNAVAILABLE",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId_REFUND_FAILED",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId_RELEASE_FAILED",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 — Salud de los cuatro servicios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "order — Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{orderUrl}}/actuator/health",
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Servicio UP\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"UP\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
